sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User
  participant App as Reference App
  participant SDK as Lazee SDK
  participant Helper as Sponsor Helper
  participant RPC as Stellar RPC
  participant Net as Stellar Network

  User->>App: Open app and choose first action
  App->>SDK: prepare sponsored action
  SDK-->>App: action preview and expected result
  User->>App: approve action
  App->>Helper: request simulation and sponsorship
  Helper->>RPC: simulate transaction
  RPC-->>Helper: simulation result
  Helper->>Net: submit sponsored transaction
  Net-->>Helper: transaction hash
  Helper->>RPC: poll transaction status
  Helper-->>App: receipt status
  App-->>User: show tx hash, status, and next step
